    <string name="faq_room_creation">房间建立</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_create">如何建立3D房间？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_create_answer">Tap Photo → 3D on the home screen toolbar (or Create Room from Photo in the empty state), then take or select a photo of your room. You\'ll see two options for creating your 3D room.</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_take_photo">如何拍照来创建房间？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_take_photo_answer">When creating a room, choose Take a Photo. You can pick Standard (1x) or Wide Angle (0.5× ultra-wide). Hold your device steady and tap capture. The photo is then used to build your 3D room.</string>
    <string name="faq_two_methods">两种房间创建方式是什么？</string>
    <string name="faq_two_methods_answer">选择照片后，您可以选择：1) AI 驱动的 3D 房间 - 使用人工智能自动创建逼真的 3D 房间，或 2) 手动设置 - 您自己绘制房间边界以获得更多控制。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_ai_room">什么是 AI 驱动的 3D 房间？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_ai_room_answer">AI Room uses GeoCalib for camera calibration and Depth Anything for metric depth to build a textured 3D room from your photo. Pick a photo and the app handles the rest; no drawing required.</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_manual_room">什么是手动设置？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_manual_room_answer">手动设置时，您在照片上绘制房间墙壁的轮廓。这样您可以更精确地控制 3D 房间的外观。当您想自己微调房间形状时非常有用。</string>
    <string name="faq_which_method_better">我该选哪种方式？</string>
    <string name="faq_which_method_better_answer">建议先试 AI 驱动 - 更快，对大多数房间效果很好。如果结果不太理想，用手动设置在您想要的位置绘制墙壁。两种都可以试试看您更喜欢哪种！</string>
    <string name="faq_best_photos">什么样的照片效果最好？</string>
    <string name="faq_best_photos_answer">为获得最佳效果，请在光线充足的环境下拍摄，并保持相机水平。尽量拍摄整个房间，包括地板、墙壁和天花板边緣。避免模糊或昏暗的照片。</string>
    <string name="faq_generation_failing">为什么我的房间产生失败？</string>
    <string name="faq_generation_failing_answer">如果照片太暗、模糊或没有显示足够的房间特征，房间产生可能会失败。请尝试在更好的光线下以更宽的角度拍摄新照片。</string>
    <string name="faq_how_many_rooms">我可以建立多少个房间？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_many_rooms_answer">你最多可以创建20个房间。删除旧房间以腾出空间。主屏幕顶部会显示房间数量和已用存储空间。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_segmentation">什么是家具分割？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_segmentation_answer">Furniture segmentation runs from the room viewer via the Fit button. By default one primary item is auto-segmented. In full-video mode, select detected items first; Segment then creates transparent cutouts only for those pieces.</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_segment">如何在房间查看器中分割家具？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_segment_answer">Tap Fit in the room viewer. For a quick check it auto-segments the main item. To pick specific pieces: summon controls, enable full-video mode, point the camera at the furniture, tap detection boxes, then tap Segment. Tap Done (top-right) to exit.</string>
    <string name="faq_not_detected">为什么我的家具没有被侦测到？</string>
    <string name="faq_not_detected_answer">家具侦测在清晰、光线充足且家具明显可见的照片中效果最佳。确保家具没有被部分遮挡或与背景融合。</string>
    <string name="faq_multiple_pieces">我可以分割多件家具嗎？</string>
    <string name="faq_multiple_pieces_answer">Yes! In full-video mode you can tap several detection boxes, then tap Segment once to cut out all selected pieces together over your 3D room. You can also segment items one at a time using the default Fit flow.</string>
    <string name="faq_room_fitment">如何查看家具是否合适？</string>
    <string name="faq_room_fitment_answer">分割后可在 3D 房间中缩放和移动抠图。全视频模式下，分割会将所选物体叠加在房间上，便于同时对比多件家具与空间。</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_view">如何检视我的3D房间？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_view_answer">在主屏幕点击任意房间打开 3D 查看器。拖动环视，捏合缩放。点击房间可唤出更多控件（重新居中、尺子、Capture）。右下角金色 Fit 按钮始终可见。</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_place">如何在房间中放置家具？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_place_answer">点击分割后，选中的家具会以叠层形式出现在房间里。拖动可定位，双指缩放可调整大小，旋转可调整方向。</string>
    <string name="faq_sample_room">我可以使用范例房间嗎？</string>
    <string name="faq_sample_room_answer">可以！应用程式提供范例房间供你体验。从探索部分存取它們，无需先建立自己的房间即可尝试家具布置。</string>
    <string name="faq_accuracy">3D模型有多准确？</string>
    <string name="faq_accuracy_answer">3D 房间是基于一张照片生成的估计结果。房间尺寸可以作为参考，但不是专业测绘级精度。家具测量在支持 AR 或深度的手机上最可靠。</string>
    <string name="faq_adjust_dimensions">我可以调整房间尺寸嗎？</string>
    <string name="faq_adjust_dimensions_answer">You cannot edit AI room dimensions manually. After saving, summon controls and tap the ruler to see estimated width, height, and depth. During the pre-save preview, dimension chips are hidden—save the room first, then reopen to see measurements. Manual rooms follow the boundaries you draw.</string>
    <string name="faq_furniture_measurements">家具与测量</string>
    <string name="faq_ar_assisted_sizing">什么是 AR 辅助家具尺寸？</string>
    <string name="faq_ar_assisted_sizing_answer">Tap Fit to segment furniture first. Use the sizing control in the summoned toolbar when you want room-relative scale. On phones with AR/depth support, the app uses live camera depth; without depth, furniture measurements are approximate.</string>
    <string name="faq_measurement_pill">画面上小小的测量提示是什么？</string>
    <string name="faq_measurement_pill_answer">家具尺寸小标签只会在尺寸模式开启且应用拿到可用的实时高度估计时出现。尺子按钮会以小卡片形式显示当前房间的宽度、高度和深度。在不支持 AR 的手机上，这些读数会更不可靠，尤其是家具尺寸。</string>
    <string name="faq_reset_overlay_scale">检测遮罩缩放看起来不对怎么办？</string>
    <string name="faq_reset_overlay_scale_answer">There is no overflow menu now. If the overlay looks off, tap Done to exit Fit and tap Fit again, or pinch the furniture manually to fine-tune its size.</string>
    <string name="faq_pinch_overlay_size">双指缩放已分割的家具时会发生什么？</string>
    <string name="faq_pinch_overlay_size_answer">双指缩放会让家具叠层变大或变小。如果尺寸模式已开启且 Furni 小标签可见，这个小标签会更新为当前按房间比例调整后的家具估计尺寸。如果尺寸模式未开启，双指缩放只会改变屏幕上叠层的视觉大小。</string>
    <string name="faq_depth_aware_room_photo">用应用内相机拍照会更好吗？</string>
    <string name="faq_depth_aware_room_photo_answer">会。在支持的设备上，创建房间时选择拍照而非从相册选取，可使用内置相机与深度信息（若设备提供），有助于构建与比例。</string>
    <string name="faq_placement_intelligence">摆放智能与美学</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_placement_intelligence">什么是「摆放智能」（Placement Intelligence）？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_placement_intelligence_answer">While Fit is active in supported 3D room viewers, a Placement Intelligence card shows whether the detected furniture fits within the room dimensions. Tap the header to expand full details, or leave it collapsed to save space.</string>
    <string name="faq_furniture_color_aesthetic">美学评分用的颜色是怎么来的？</string>
    <string name="faq_furniture_color_aesthetic_answer">应用会对你看到的 AI 家具抠图（与实时分割叠加层相同）里、不透明像素的颜色做 RGB 平均，再与从地面、墙面、天花板采样的颜色比较。若抠图尚未就绪，会暂用房间调色板的推断色，直到分割给出真实采样。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_do_harmony_contrast_mean">和谐度、对比度、风格匹配是什么意思？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_do_harmony_contrast_mean_answer">它们只是简单的设计启发规则，不是品味评判。和谐度描述家具颜色与房间主色之间的关系（例如类似色或互补色）。对比度衡量与典型地面、墙面亮度的差异。风格匹配把从房间推断的宽泛风格标签与默认的「现代/简约」档案对比，因此仅供参考。</string>
    <string name="faq_when_does_aesthetic_score_low">什么情况下美学分数会偏低或显示「冲突（clash）」？</string>
    <string name="faq_when_does_aesthetic_score_low_answer">高饱和物体若色相与应用内的和谐配色规则、以及你房间采样色不协调，分数往往更低——例如酸绿、品红、紫色、安全橙放在偏米色、暖棕调房间里，或空间采样几乎单色时仍用刺眼原色。与地板或墙面亮度非常接近（棕上棕、灰上灰）也可能拉低对比度，即便你主观上喜欢。若房间被推断为乡村风、传统风，风格匹配可能偏低，因为家具档案默认带现代/简约标签。杂乱背景下得到的灰蒙蒙平均色有时会落在「中性」区间而非冲突。分数仅供提示，实际搭配请以肉眼为准。</string>
