    <string name="faq_what_is_brain_icon">Fit 按钮有什么作用？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_brain_icon_answer">在房间查看器中点击右下角金色 Fit 按钮即可启动 SmartyPants 家具分割。默认会自动分割置信度最高的物品，并以透明抠图叠加在 3D 房间上。点击右上角完成退出。要选择特定物品，请先唤出控件并开启 full-video 模式。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_viewfinder_button_answer">While Fit is active, summon controls and tap the viewfinder icon to toggle full-video mode. You get a live camera feed with detection boxes—tap one or more items, then tap Segment. The camera hides and transparent cutouts composite over your 3D room. Tap Done (top-right) to exit segment mode or leave Fit entirely.</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_viewfinder_button">What does full-video mode do in the room viewer?</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_screenshot">如何截屏？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_screenshot_answer">点击房间唤出控件，然后点按 Capture。可将当前视图（Fit 开启时含家具叠加层）保存到照片图库。</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_save_room">如何保存房间？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_save_room_answer">After generating a 3D room, tap the room to summon controls, then tap the save icon (download arrow) and enter a name. If you leave a preview without saving, that room is discarded.</string>
    <string name="faq_room_controls">3D 房间控制</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_navigate">如何在房间内导航？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_navigate_answer">Drag on the room to orbit the camera and pinch to zoom. Tap the screen to summon the toolbar, then use the viewfinder icon to recenter. A quiet summon disk at bottom-left also brings controls back when hidden.</string>
    <string name="faq_what_do_arrows_do">如何显示或隐藏查看器控件？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_do_arrows_do_answer">房间查看器为沉浸模式—控件会隐藏以保持画面简洁。点击房间唤出工具栏。右下角金色 Fit 按钮始终可见。Fit 激活时，右上角会显示完成以退出分割。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_memory_display">MB 数字是什么意思？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_memory_display_answer">房间中显示的 MB（兆字节）表示文件大小。这有助于您管理存储空间。所有房间使用的总存储空间显示在主屏幕顶部。</string>
